- Player spawns at `(0, 1, 4)` relative. Birch button is at `(-3, 2, 2)`. Horizontal distance from spawn to button: √(9+4) ≈ 3.6 blocks — well within the 5-block threshold, so the milestone is achievable from the spawn area by simply turning to face the button.
